  _title: Goodbye,
  _titleKey: TT2EMAIL_BIZARRO_TITLE
  _message: Hey, it am me. Bizarro. I have favor ask you. The Boss sent some of us villains to hand out flyers for Legion. But it very hard work. Strict quota to meet. Maybe you help them out and take some flyers? There one in each city. If we hand out enough, we get pizza party. Ok, bye.
